{"page":196,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:55","surah":9,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَا تُعْجِبْكَ أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ وَلَآ أَوْلَـٰدُهُمْ ۚ إِنَّمَا يُرِيدُ ٱللَّهُ لِيُعَذِّبَهُم بِهَا فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَتَزْهَقَ أَنفُسُهُمْ وَهُمْ كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Prophet] do not let their possessions or their children impress you: through these God intends to punish them in this world and for their souls to depart while they disbelieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"So (let) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُعْجِبْكَ","en_gloss":"impress you","transliteration":"tuʿ'jib'ka","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their wealth","transliteration":"amwāluhum","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْلَـٰدُهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their children","transliteration":"awlāduhum","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"Allah intends","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah intends","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِيُعَذِّبَهُم","en_gloss":"to punish them","transliteration":"liyuʿadhibahum","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَتَزْهَقَ","en_gloss":"and should depart","transliteration":"watazhaqa","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَنفُسُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their souls","transliteration":"anfusuhum","verse_key":"9:55"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while th